{"sourceUrl":"https://ggxy.gxu.edu.cn/info/1989/6937.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:14.405226+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://ggxy.gxu.edu.cn/info/1989/6937.htm","html":"<div>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span>为增进优秀大学生对广西大学公共管理学院的了解，感知名师魅力，激发学生科研兴趣，提供师生相互交流与学习的平台，并考察学生的学业水平、科研能力与综合素质等，我院将于</span><strong><span>2025年7月2日-4日</span></strong><span><span>，以线上线下相结合的方式，举办广西大学公共管理学院</span><span>2025年优秀大学生“博学”夏令营。</span></span></p>\n<h1><strong><span>一、学院</span></strong><strong><span>简</span></strong><strong><span>介</span></strong></h1>\n<p><span><span>广西大学坐落于风景如画的广西首府南宁，是广西办学历史最悠久、规模最大的综合性大学，是广西唯一的国家</span><span>“</span></span><span>211工程”建设学校，世界一流学科建设高校，教育部和广西壮族自治区人民政府“部区合建”高校。</span></p>\n<p><span>广西大学公共管理学院成立于</span><span>2005年9月，是广西大学重要的骨干支撑学院，前身可追溯到广西大学成立初期的法商学院法政系。公共管理类专业源于哲学系20世纪80年代设置的行政管理、公共关系两个专科专业。1999年新办旅游管理专业，2002年新办公共事业管理专业。2019年公共事业管理专业入选首批国家一流本科专业建设点，是广西高等学校特色专业。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院下设行政管理、公共政策（公共事业管理）、劳动与社会保障、土地资源管理四个系（教研室）。拥有省级科研平台广西高校人文社会科学重点研究基地</span><span>“区域社会治理创新研究中心”，以及绿色发展与边疆治理研究院、应急管理与数字治理研究院、东盟社会组织与公共管理研究中心等</span></span><span>6个校级研究平台。</span></p>\n<p><span>学院拥有公共管理一级学科博士点、公共管理一级学科硕士点和公共管理专业硕士（</span><span>MPA）学位授权点。公共管理一级学科博士点和一级学科硕士点下设有行政管理、公共政策、社会组织与基层治理、土地资源管理、绿色发展与边疆治理等研究方向。公共管理学科现为广西壮族自治区重点学科，是广西大学“211工程”和“中西部高校综合实力提升工程”重点建设的学科领域，在绿色发展与边疆治理、乡村振兴、生态文明治理、社会组织发展、区域社会治理创新等领域已形成了鲜明的特色与优势。</span></p>\n<p><span>广西大学公共管理学院优秀本科生夏令营自</span><span>2019年开始举办，至今已成功举办六届，秉承西大公管学院“博学、笃行”的院训，为校内外优秀学子提供近距离认识公管学院学科、感知名师魅力的契机。从2021年起，我校所有专业优先录取第一志愿复试合格考生，夏令营是保障优质生源比例的重要措施之一。参加广西大学公共管理学院2025年优秀大学生“博学”夏令营（第七届）的部分学员将有机会获得公管学院2026年推荐免试研究生选拔的入场券，同等条件下优先考虑有直博意愿的学员。</span></p>\n<h1><strong><span>二、申请条件</span></strong></h1>\n<p><strong><span>（一）申请人数与专业</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>广西大学公共管理学院</span><span>2025年优秀大学生“博学”夏令营规模100人左右，招生对象为全国“985”、“211”工程高校或省属管理类重点学科高校的优秀本科三年级在校生。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>（二）申请条件</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1. 国内有研究生推免资格高校的三年级（预计2026年夏季本科毕业）优秀在校生：管理类相关专业的本科生，或具备一定的管理学科基础或者修过相关课程的非管理类专业学生；</span></p>\n<p><span>2. 学习成绩优秀，本科前三年（或前五学期）总评成绩排名在本校本年级本专业前20%；在其他方面有优异表现者，如有相关科研成果（需提供相关材料扫描件），可适当放宽条件；</span></p>\n<p><span>3. 具有较强的创新意识和专业研究能力，学习刻苦、勤奋、成绩优秀。优先选拔具有较强科研能力的学生；</span></p>\n<p><span>4. 英语水平良好；</span></p>\n<p><span>5. 遵守学术道德规范。</span></p>\n<h1><strong><span>三、申请流程</span></strong></h1>\n<p><strong><span>（一）</span></strong><strong><span>报</span></strong><strong><span>名</span></strong><strong><span>时间</span></strong><strong><span>和材料</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>广西大学公共管理学院</span><span>2025年</span><span>优</span><span>秀大学生</span><span>“博学”夏令</span><span>营</span><span>采用</span><span>电</span><span>子</span><span>邮</span><span>件</span><span>报</span><span>名，不接受</span><span>纸质</span><span>材料申</span><span>请</span><span>。</span><span>请</span><span>有意向、符合申</span><span>请</span><span>条件的同学于</span><strong><span>6月12日-6月23日</span></strong><span>将以下申</span><span>请</span><span>材料</span><span>发</span><span>至</span><span>邮</span><span>箱：</span><strong><span>fanlu@gxu.edu.cn</span></strong><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>1.《广西大学2025年</span><span>优</span><span>秀大学生</span><span>“博学”夏令</span><span>营</span><span>申</span><span>请</span><span>表》和《广西大学</span><span>2025年</span><span>优</span><span>秀大学生</span><span>“博学”夏令</span><span>营汇总</span><span>表》</span><span>电</span><span>子文件；</span></p>\n<p><span>2. 本科</span><span>阶</span><span>段成</span><span>绩单图</span><span>像文件（截至申</span><span>请</span><span>日所能提供的成</span><span>绩单</span><span>，由学校教</span><span>务</span><span>部门盖章）；</span></p>\n<p><span>3. 前五学期</span><span>总评</span><span>成</span><span>绩</span><span>排名</span><span>证</span><span>明</span><span>图</span><span>像文件（由所在学院出具</span><span>证</span><span>明）；</span></p>\n<p><span>4. 提交本科</span><span>专业</span><span>研究</span><span>领</span><span>域范</span><span>围</span><span>内的个人代表性学</span><span>术</span><span>成果</span><span>1篇；</span></p>\n<p><span>要求：在校期</span><span>间</span><span>完成的；申</span><span>请</span><span>者必</span><span>须拥</span><span>有独立知</span><span>识产</span><span>权；可以是公开</span><span>发</span><span>表的，也可以是未</span><span>发</span><span>表的；格式符合学</span><span>术规</span><span>范；使用</span><span>word或pdf格式。</span></p>\n<p><span>5. 其它材料</span></p>\n<p><span><span>包括：</span><span>①英</span></span><span>语</span><span>水平的</span><span>证</span><span>明材</span><span><span>料；</span><span>②大学期</span></span><span>间发</span><span>表的学</span><span>术论</span><span>文（如有），期刊</span><span>论</span><span>文要求复印期刊封面、目</span><span>录</span><span>、正文和版权</span><span>页</span><span><span>；著作提供原件一本；</span><span>③其他</span></span><span>获</span><span>校</span><span>级</span><span>以上</span><span>奖</span><span>励的</span><span>证</span><span>明材料。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>注：</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1.上述材料一起</span><span>压缩</span><span>成</span><span>ZIP文件（文件命名格式：</span><strong><span><span>学校</span>+</span></strong><strong><span>专业</span></strong><strong><span>+姓名</span></strong><span>），</span><span>发</span><span>送至</span><strong><span>fanlu@gxu.edu.cn</span></strong><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span>2.申</span><span>请</span><span>人提交的全部申</span><span>请</span><span>材料</span><span>应</span><span>保</span><span>证</span><span>其真</span><span>实</span><span>性与准确性，</span><span>责</span><span>任自</span><span>负</span><span>；申</span><span>请</span><span>材料不全将不予受理；所提交材料不退</span><span>还</span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span>3.入</span><span>选营员报</span><span>到</span><span>时</span><span>，</span><span>应</span><span>提供与网申填</span><span>报</span><span>信息一致的</span><span>纸质</span><span>材料，材料</span><span>须</span><span>真</span><span>实</span><span>有效。如有弄虚作假，取消入</span><span>营资</span><span>格，并通</span><span>报</span><span>申</span><span>请</span><span>人所在院校。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>（二）</span></strong><strong><span>报</span></strong><strong><span>名材料</span></strong><strong><span>审</span></strong><strong><span>核</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span>6月24日-6月27日</span></strong><span>为</span><span>材料</span><span>审</span><span>核</span><span>阶</span><span>段。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>（三）</span></strong><strong><span>结</span></strong><strong><span>果公布</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span>6月28日公布</span></strong><strong><span>结</span></strong><strong><span>果。</span></strong><span>入</span><span>选</span><span>名</span><span>单</span><span>将在广西大学公共管理学院网站公布，</span><span>请</span><span>注意</span><span>查</span><span>看。入</span><span>选营员应</span><span>在</span><span>营员录</span><span>取名</span><span>单</span><span>公布之日起</span><span>2日内</span><span>发</span><span>送</span><span>“XXX同意按</span><span>时</span><span>参加广西大学公共管理学院夏令</span><span>营</span><span>”</span><span>为</span><span>内容的</span><span>电</span><span>子</span><span>邮</span><span>件确</span><span>认</span><span>是否参加。逾期未确</span><span>认</span><span>的，</span><span>视为</span><span>放弃此</span><span>资</span><span>格。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>（四）身份核</span></strong><strong><span>验</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>在开</span><span>营</span><span>前，学</span><span>员</span><span>凭身份</span><span>证</span><span>和学生</span><span>证进</span><span>行</span><span>线</span><span>上核</span><span>验</span><span>身份</span><span>。</span></p>\n<h1><strong><span>四、夏令营安排</span></strong></h1>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><p><strong><span>时间</span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span>活</span></strong><strong><span>动</span></strong><strong><span>内容（</span></strong><strong><span>拟</span></strong><strong><span>定）</span></strong></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><strong><span>7月2日上午</span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><span>开</span><span>营仪</span><span>式、云游校园</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><strong><span>7月2日下午</span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><span>招生政策</span><span>讲</span><span>解</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><strong><span>7月3日上午</span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><span>“</span><span>导师</span><span><span>工作坊</span><span>”（多个工作坊同</span></span><span>时进</span><span><span>行，如</span><span>“公共政策案例解剖室”“社会研究方法工作坊”“数字治理</span></span><span>实验</span><span><span>室</span><span>”，</span></span><span>营员</span><span>自主</span><span>选择</span><span>主</span><span>题</span><span>）</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><strong><span>7月3日下午</span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><span>文献精</span><span>读</span><span>分享（分</span><span>组进</span><span>行文献分享，作</span><span>为</span><span>考核</span><span>环节</span><span>之一）</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><strong><span>7月4日上午</span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><span>营员</span><span>代表</span><span>汇报</span><span>（卓越</span><span>营员选</span><span>拔）、</span><span>闭营仪</span><span>式</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h1><strong><span>五、优秀营员的选拔</span></strong></h1>\n<p><span>在广西大学公共管理学院</span><span>2025年</span><span>优</span><span>秀大学生</span><span>“博学”夏令</span><span>营</span><span>活</span><span>动</span><span>期</span><span>间</span><span>，学院将开展卓越</span><span>营员</span><span>的</span><span>选</span><span>拔考核工作。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>（一）</span></strong><strong><span>选</span></strong><strong><span>拔考核的内容</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1. 夏令</span><span>营</span><span>参与</span><span>积</span><span>极性（</span><span>20%）</span></p>\n<p><span>2. 文献精</span><span>读</span><span>分享（</span><span>50%）</span></p>\n<p><span>3. </span><span>营员</span><span>代表</span><span>汇报</span><span>（</span><span>30%）</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>（二）</span></strong><strong><span>选</span></strong><strong><span>拔考核成</span></strong><strong><span>绩</span></strong><strong><span>的运用</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>学院根据</span><span>选</span><span>拔考核</span><span>综</span><span>合成</span><span>绩</span><span>确定卓越</span><span>营员</span><span>和</span><span>优</span><span>秀</span><span>营员</span><span>名</span><span>单</span><span>，并</span><span>颁发</span><span>“卓越</span><span>营员证书</span><span>”和“</span><span>优</span><span>秀</span><span>营员证书</span><span>”</span><span>。</span></p>\n<h1><strong><span>六、联系与咨询</span></strong></h1>\n<p><span>请</span><span>有意申</span><span>请</span><span>的同学</span><span>继续</span><span>留意后</span><span>续</span><span>相关通知。</span></p>\n<p><span>联</span><span>系地址：广西南宁市大学</span><span>东</span><span>路</span><span>100号广西大学公共管理学院110</span><span>办</span><span>公室</span></p>\n<p><span>联</span><span>系人：樊老</span><span>师</span></p>\n<p><span>电话</span><span>：</span><span>0771-3235695</span></p>\n<p><span>E-mail：</span><a href=\"mailto:fanlu@gxu.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>fanlu@gxu.edu.cn</span></span></a></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><strong><span>欢</span></strong><strong><span>迎各高校</span></strong><strong><span>2026届</span></strong><strong><span>优</span></strong><strong><span>秀</span></strong><strong><span>应</span></strong><strong><span>届本科</span></strong><strong><span>毕业</span></strong><strong><span>生</span></strong><strong><span>积</span></strong><strong><span>极</span></strong><strong><span>报</span></strong><strong><span>名，</span></strong><strong><span>欢</span></strong><strong><span>迎来</span></strong><strong><span>电</span></strong><strong><span>咨</span></strong><strong><span>询</span></strong><strong><span>相关信息</span></strong><strong><span>。</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><span>编辑</span><span>︱王星</span>  <span>一</span><span>审</span><span>一校︱</span><span>陈</span><span>一德</span>  <span>二</span><span>审</span><span>二校︱刘佩瑶</span>  <span>三</span><span>审</span><span>三校︱于</span><span>丹</span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div>","textSha256":"9a7b8a080a8bf5028e1eedfe836ec5cbb2bb2d27d13e45cc10b797780bc9c89a","textLength":2602,"sourceSha256":"c253c05fde58aa8ce5042ca01212d8538c6dcc7cc81a1cb3e083be68c2217f2f","selector":".v_news_content","attachments":[{"name":"广西大学2025年优秀大学生“博学”夏令营汇总表.xlsx","url":"https://ggxy.gxu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1400998036&wbfileid=15054078"},{"name":"广西大学2025年优秀大学生“博学”夏令营申请表.docx","url":"https://ggxy.gxu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1400998036&wbfileid=15054079"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-8a94fb980669eae7b3bd","title":"2025年广西大学公共管理学院2025年优秀大学生“博学”夏令营招生简章","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:14.405226+00:00"}
